# JFR recordings are 50-250 MB each (1.9 GB for this run); they stay local and are regenerated by
# run-groovy-benchmarks.sh (load phases) and run-groovy-followups.sh (cache-jfr)
*.jfr
# the repository ignores *.log, but the GC logs are the source of truth for pauses and heap after GC, and the
# JMH logs record each run's settings and warnings
!*.log
